Alembic migrations for the Buzz Bitez database

- Never edit a migration that's already merged into main. Add a new one instead.
- Pull main before running `alembic revision --autogenerate`, so two people
  don't branch off the same revision ("multiple heads" error).
- Always read the generated file before committing. Autogenerate treats a
  renamed column as drop + add, which deletes that column's data.
- Setup and commands: see RESTEndpoint/README.md.
